# Mobile (`apps/mobile`)

- Flutter multi-role app. Theme tokens in `lib/theme/`; shared components in `lib/design_system/`.
- Follow existing feature folder layout under `lib/features/`.
- Do not embed backend secrets. Use the documented API client / env patterns.
- Design system PRD: `docs/product/prd/07-ui-ux-design-system-prd-v1.md`.
